                                "text": "Where did the new approach [of broken windows policing] go off track? The difficulty can be traced back to the categories of \"honest persons\" and \"the disorderly.\" Under the broken windows theory, these categories are vested with a certain naturalness, or fixity, or organicity. It is as if the world were naturally divided into law abiders and lawbreakers."
